      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Round 1: magic ring, 6 dc. Round 2: 2 dc in each st. Round 3: * 2 dc, 1 dc; rep. Continue adding 6 dc per round until circle reaches 30 cm. Sl st to close last round. Fasten off."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
